{"parse": {"title": "Griffin (Ascension)", "pageid": 3894, "revid": 46541, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><center>\n<div class=\"game-font-face TEST\" style=\"padding: 10px 15px; border-left: 4px solid #FFC71E; border-right: 4px solid #FFC71E; width: calc(70% + 30px); background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 40% 70%,#00000042 35%, #ffec90 100%); box-shadow: inset 0 0 9px 0 #f6d100, 0 0 6px 0 #ff002447; border-radius: 14px; font-size: 85%; background-position-y: top; background-position-x: -13px; background-size: 150% 110%; margin: 6px 0 0; line-height: 1.25; color: #dcdce6;\"><span style=\"font-size: 140%;color: hwb(240deg 86% 0%);\">Meta Unit</span><br />This unit is one of the most effective units in the game!</div>\n</center>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Overview\">Overview</span></h2>\n<p><b>Griffin (Ascension)</b> is a <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> unit. He can only be obtained by evolving <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin\" title=\"Griffin\">Griffin</a>. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Evolving\">Evolving</span></h2>\n<p><strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">Griffin (Ascension)</strong> can be evolved from <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin\" title=\"Griffin\">Griffin</a> with the following materials:\n</p>\n<table class=\"article-table game-font-face\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Required Items:\n</td>\n<td style=\"display: flex; gap: 25px;\"><span>x1 <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin\" title=\"Griffin\">Griffin</a><br /></span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Result\n</td>\n<td><dd class=\"ChBox&#95;item Rarity(Mythic)\">\n<div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;item&#95;contet&#95;container\"><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;background\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;img&#95;&#95;item\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Ascension)\" title=\"Griffin (Ascension)\"><img alt=\"Griffin (Ascension)\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/a/a5/Griffin_%28Ascension%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20230714132510\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"101\" height=\"102\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Griffin (Ascension).png\" data-image-key=\"Griffin_%28Ascension%29.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" /></a></span></div></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text&#95;boxShadow\"></div><div class=\"ChBox&#95;text Fz(74%)\">Griffin<br />(Ascension)</div></dd>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<p>Before evolving this unit, the unit must have 7,500 Takedowns.\n<sup id=\"cite&#95;ref-1\" class=\"reference\"><a href=\"#cite_note-1\"><span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#91;</span>1<span class=\"cite-bracket\">&#93;</span></a></sup>\n</p><p>Additionally, he requires either 200 Eggs of Sacrifice or 24 <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span> or 12 evolved <span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Mythical) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\">Mythical<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\">Mythical</span></span>  units. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stats_Overview\">Stats Overview</span></h2>\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default type-character\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title1\">Griffin (Ascension)</h2>\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\" data-item-name=\"img\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-item-name=\"section1\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tOriginal Skin\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\" data-item-name=\"section1\">\n\t\t\t\t\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\" data-source=\"image1\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/0e/Griffin_%28Ascension%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20250411105341\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"Griffin (Ascension) (Pose)\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/0e/Griffin_%28Ascension%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20250411105341\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/0e/Griffin_%28Ascension%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/267?cb=20250411105341 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/0/0e/Griffin_%28Ascension%29_%28Pose%29.png/revision/latest?cb=20250411105341 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"Griffin (Ascension) (Pose)\" width=\"270\" height=\"266\" data-image-key=\"Griffin_%28Ascension%29_%28Pose%29.png\" data-image-name=\"Griffin (Ascension) (Pose).png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t<figcaption class=\"pi-item-spacing pi-caption\">\"Among thousands of comrades and ten thousand enemies, you're the only one who made me forget my dream. I... sacrifice.\"</figcaption>\n</figure>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"deployment_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Deployment Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">1,000¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"total_cost\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Total Cost</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"text-shadow: 0 0 3px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black, 0 0 2px black;color: #ffc608;\">3,500¥</span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"upgrade_levels\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Upgrade Levels</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">1</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"spawn_cap\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Spawn Cap</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">3</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Tower_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Tower Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Ground</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Damage_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Damage Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #38fcff; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa, 0 0 2px #0f3efa;\">Magic </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113212417\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Magic\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3b/Damage_type_Magic.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113212417\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Magic.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Magic.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Secondary_Damage_type\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Secondary Damage Type</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><span style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 2px;\"><span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"color: #6d6da3; text-shadow: 0 0 2px #27003a, 0 0 2px #27003a, 0 0 2px #27003a;\">Dark </span> <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/32/Damage_type_Dark.png/revision/latest?cb=20221113230911\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Damage type Dark\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/32/Damage_type_Dark.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221113230911\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Damage type Dark.png\" data-image-key=\"Damage_type_Dark.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span></span></div>\n</div>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Attack Stats</h2>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"damage\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Damage</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">510 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"seconds_per_attack\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Attack Rate</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">7.5 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"range\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Range</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">20 -&gt;</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden game-font-face advanced-tooltip\" style=\"position: relative; user-select: none;z-index: 5;color: #ffffff8f;font-size: 13px;\"><div class=\"dottedText C(#3a3a3a)-Th-L\" style=\"position: absolute; top: -43px; right: 0; cursor: help; border-bottom: 2px dotted;\">Why do I have different stats?</div><div class=\"tooltip-contents\" style=\"display: none\"><div class=\"game-tooltip&#95;&#95;container game-font-face\">Units in this game use a randomized system, where stats like damage are randomly rolled with about a 10% variance (like Dungeon Quest items). When you evolve a unit they also reroll their stats, but it will always be strictly better than the pre-evolved version.</div></div></div><div class=\"article-table mobileonly\"><i><a href=\"/wiki/Frequently_Asked_Questions\" title=\"Frequently Asked Questions\">Why do I have different stats?</a></i><br /></div><div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; z-index: 5;\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; width: 124px; justify-content: flex-start; position: absolute; left: 234px; top: -48px; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;OFF mw-customtoggle-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;ON\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\"><div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%;\">\n<p>Buff\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Buff&#95;OFF\" style=\"display: none; transform: translate(0, -70px);\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column-reverse; align-items: center;gap: 3px;\">\n<div style=\"position: relative; user-select: none; width: 100px;\">\n<div class=\"buffList\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-content: center; justify-content: center; align-items: center; height: 100%;\">\n<p>Buff\n</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; gap: 4px;\">\n<div class=\"mw-customtoggle-Sakura\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\">\n<div>\n<div class=\"mobile-hidden Scale(1.061):h game-font-face buffList-B-Sakuro ChBox&#95;item\" style=\"bor