\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">2,500¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>+ Stage</li>   </ul>\n</div></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"Stats-Box\" id=\"Stats-Box-ON\">\n<div class=\"buffEffect&#95;&#95;box H(100%) W(100%)\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SakuroAuraBuff H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sakura\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;SkyEnchantment H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Sasageyo\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed buffEffect&#95;&#95;KannonbirakiBenihimeAratame H(100%) W(100%)\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-Kisoko\" style=\"display: none;\"></div>\n</div>\n<h3><span id=\"Upgrade_1_-_2.2C500.C2.A5_2\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Upgrade_1_-_2,500¥_2\"><div style=\"display: flex; justify-content: space-between;\"><span>Upgrade 1 - <span class=\"game-font-face Tsh(Game) C(Yen)\">2,500¥</span></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"font-size: 90%; align-self: center; gap: 9px; display: flex; padding: 0 9px;\"> </span></div></span></h3>\n<ul><li>+ Stage</li>   </ul>\n</div></div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box&#95;&#95;Container\">\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-OFF\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n<div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-statsBox\" style=\"display: none;\">\n<div class=\"click-on-I-Box\" id=\"click-on-I-Box-ON\">⁣⁣⁣⁣click on any part of the information block</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Sacrifice\">Sacrifice</span></h2>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Griffin_(Reincarnation)\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Griffin_(Darkness)\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Griffin (Darkness)</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Reincarnation)\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation)\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</a>​ -​ Sacrificed BUFF Types\n<ul><li>Note that not all support units can be used for this variant. Unsellable units cannot be used for sacrifice. (e.g Idol and Idol (Idol) ).</li>\n<li>The percentage will show up in <font color=\"yellow\">Yellow</font> if the unit was a BUFF type.</li>\n<li>The reincarnation variant's buff can be stacked with <a href=\"/wiki/Blossom\" title=\"Blossom\">Blossom</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\">Commander</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wenda\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Wenda\">Wenda</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Elfy_(Sylph)\" title=\"Elfy (Sylph)\">Elfy (Sylph)</a>  buff.</li>\n<li>The reincarnation variant's buff stacks additively with all other buffs.</li>\n<li>The reincarnation variant needs a minimum of 100,000¥ to summon.<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></li></ul></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><li><a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Darkness)\" title=\"Griffin (Darkness)\">Griffin (Darkness)</a>​ -​ Sacrifice non-BUFF Types\n<ul><li>The percentage will show up in <font color=\"red\">Red</font> if the unit was a DAMAGE type.</li>\n<li>The darkness variant needs a minimum of 100,000¥ so 1 maxed out <a href=\"/wiki/Hubris_(The_One)\" title=\"Hubris (The One)\">Hubris (The One)</a> (without <a href=\"/wiki/Idol_(Star)\" title=\"Idol (Star)\">Idol (Star)</a>) can summon instantly.</li>\n<li>The darkness variant's damage can be increased above the 100% threshold, the increase in dmg per&#160;!% extra is unknown currently due to the fact that it increases then at some specific percentage begins to decrease.<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></li></ul></li></div></div>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Selling\">Selling</span></h2>\n<p>Units sell for 25% of their deployment cost, However <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Reincarnation)\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation)\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</a> cannot be sold.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Shiny Griffin appears as <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Reincarnation)\" title=\"Griffin (Reincarnation)\">Griffin (Reincarnation)</a> in the lobby, instead of <a href=\"/wiki/Griffin_(Darkness)\" title=\"Griffin (Darkness)\">Griffin (Darkness)</a> like normal.</li>\n<li>Before Update 17, the reincarnation variant costed a minimum of 30,000¥ to summon, and it used to stack multiplicatively with <a href=\"/wiki/Commander\" title=\"Commander\">Commander</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Wind_Dragon\" title=\"Wind Dragon\">Wind Dragon</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Elfy_(Sylph)\" title=\"Elfy (Sylph)\">Elfy (Sylph)</a> buffs. This has since been increased to 100,000¥, and his buff now stacks additively to all other damage buffs.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">Gallery</span></h2>\n<div class=\"mw-references-wrap\"><ol class=\"references\">\n<li id=\"cite&#95;note-1\"><span class=\"mw-cite-backlink\"><a href=\"#cite_ref-1\">↑</a></span> <span class=\"reference-text\">Takedowns refer to kills or assists</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261022215656\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.156 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.193 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1440/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 86630/2097152 bytes\nTempl